1. Main tasks in a data project
1. Data collection
Gather data from CSV, Excel, databases, APIs, or websites.
Python tools: pandas, requests, sqlite3
2. Data cleaning
Handle missing values, duplicates, incorrect formats, and inconsistent data.
Python tools: pandas, numpy
3. Exploratory data analysis (EDA)
Explore patterns, trends, distributions, and relationships in the data.
Python tools: pandas, matplotlib, seaborn
4. Data visualization
Create charts, graphs, dashboards, and reports.
Python tools: matplotlib, seaborn, plotly
5. Statistical analysis and machine learning
Identify relationships, test hypotheses, predict outcomes, or group similar records.
Python tools: scipy, statsmodels, scikit-learn
6. Reporting and deployment
Present findings, automate reports, or publish a data application.
Python tools: Jupyter, Streamlit, FastAPI

